    "description": "📄 Product Description This is a high-performance through-beam photoelectric sensor designed for accurate and long-distance object detection in industrial automation systems. It operates using a separate emitter and receiver setup, where an infrared light beam is transmitted from the emitter to the receiver, and detection occurs when the beam is interrupted by an object. The sensor offers a long sensing range of up to 15 meters, making it ideal for applications requiring reliable detection over extended distances. It provides stable performance regardless of object color or surface characteristics, ensuring consistent operation in demanding environments. Equipped with an NPN output and fast response time, it is suitable for high-speed production lines and precise positioning applications. The device supports Light-ON and Dark-ON modes, allowing flexible integration with PLCs and control systems. Built with a compact and rugged housing, it features a high protection rating, ensuring resistance against dust and water. Its durable design makes it suitable for use in harsh industrial conditions. Widely used in conveyor systems, packaging machines, warehouse automation, and material handling applications, this sensor ensures reliable, non-contact detection and enhances overall system efficiency. 🔧 Key Features Through-beam sensing method (emitter + receiver) Long sensing range up to 15 meters Infrared light source NPN output Fast response time Light-ON / Dark-ON selectable High resistance to dust and water (industrial protection) Compact and durable design 📌 Short Description If you want, I can also: Make SEO keywords (IndiaMART ranking) Create comparison content (through-beam vs retro-reflective) Add technical",
